 "name": "ST59EV_EVENT00.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "With the end of the One Year War,",
  "Jaburo acquired an entirely",
  "different strategic value.",
  "Jaburo, by rights",
  "a mere regional base",
  "in the Amazon basin,",
  "came to be mistaken",
  "for the headquarters",
  "of the Earth Federation.",
  "Like an emperor's",
  "imperial seal in the old era,",
  "holding Jaburo",
  "came to be spoken of",
  "as if it conferred",
  "a government's legitimacy.",
  "By rights, that was",
  "a mistake politically",
  "and strategically alike,",
  "but most of those",
  "with the intelligence",
  "to point it out",
  "had died in the One Year War.",
  "Had Revil still been alive,",
  "he would have laughed to see",
  "the giant decoy he had set up,",
  "the dummy that was Jaburo,",
  "take on real substance.",
  "Jamitov, who might be called",
  "Revil's faithful heir,",
  "turned the situation to his use",
  "and declared Jaburo",
  "the Titans' headquarters.",
  "Actual production",
  "was dispersed to Gryps,",
  "Konpei Island,",
  "New Guinea,",
  "Kilimanjaro and elsewhere,",
  "with only the command center,",
  "movable at any time,",
  "kept at Jaburo.",
  "In fact, though,",
  "most of Jaburo's forces",
  "had already begun moving",
  "to Gryps",
  "and New Guinea.",
  "Both were newer bases,",
  "and far more capable",
  "strategically than Jaburo,",
  "whose only virtue",
  "was its bedrock.",
  "Jamitov Hymem",
  "had read all of this",
  "with precision.",
  "He had foreseen that the AEUG,",
  "driven to lash out",
  "by Bask's crackdown,",
  "would surely",
  "strike at Jaburo.",
  "Jaburo Underground",
  "Jerid",
  "\"I won't let the space crowd",
  " have their way with this place.",
  " Earth is our homeland!\"",
  "Officer",
  "\"...Area 1 has been",
  " completely overrun.\"",
  "\"That's ridiculous!",
  " How can we hand this place",
  " over so easily!\"",
  "\"The truth is, Jaburo's",
  " in the middle of a move!\"",
  "\"A move!?",
  " What for!\"",
  "\"Orders, sir. That's why",
  " the Garudas are being mobilized...\"",
  "Soldier",
  "\"Lieutenant! Please fall back!\"",
  "\"Run if you want to run!\"",
  "\"There's no time, Lieutenant!",
  " Please fall back!\"",
  "But his foresight beyond that",
  "can fairly be called diabolical.",
  "Perhaps as many as 150 MS",
  "from both AEUG and Titans broke",
  "through the upper atmosphere.",
  "To these",
  "were added the Jaburo garrison,",
  "relocating though it was,",
  "the Titans' reserves",
  "and more.",
  "It was one of the largest",
  "battles of this conflict,",
  "known as the Gryps Conflict.",
  "Jamitov meant to annihilate",
  "these forces and Jaburo",
  "with nuclear weapons.",
  "Of course, there was",
  "the unwritten rule of the",
  "Antarctic Treaty, banning nukes.",
  "But",
  "this was the Federation's civil war,",
  "and an unwritten rule is just that.",
  "If the old-era nukes stored",
  "at Jaburo were set off,",
  "no one in the public eye",
  "could hold anyone to account.",
  "The friendly troops who dropped in",
  "would die too; most were amateurs.",
  "And if they vanished",
  "along with Jaburo,",
  "it could be trumpeted as damage",
  "from the AEUG's attack.",
  "Above all, results outweigh means:",
  "that idea was the foundation",
  "of Jamitov's thinking, and thus",
  "of the Titans' as well.",
  "Garuda super-large transport",
  "Old-model mobile suits",
  "The Garuda.",
  "Developed after the One Year War,",
  "it was a gigantic aircraft with",
  "a wingspan of over 500 meters.",
  "Of all conventional aircraft,",
  "those that do not use",
  "the Minovsky Craft,",
  "it was the largest in human history.",
  "Flying on and on as it circled",
  "the Earth, this aircraft",
  "was originally built to lift",
  "space shuttles into space.",
  "It could land only",
  "on a Jaburo-class runway;",
  "otherwise it must land on water",
  "or take on supplies in flight.",
  "Using the Garuda",
  "to launch shuttles",
  "from its circling flight",
  "cut costs",
  "dramatically.",
  "Able to move wherever needed",
  "and carry large shuttles,",
  "several at a time,",
  "up into space,",
  "the Garuda,",
  "for the Sides dealt",
  "devastating blows",
  "in the One Year War, was vital",
  "to their recovery.",
  "But now that it had come to this,",
  "in a situation no one",
  "had ever planned for,",
  "Jaburo's flight by night,",
  "the Garuda leapt onto",
  "history's main stage",
  "as a weapon.",
  "After all,",
  "a giant aircraft able to fly",
  "fully laden with shuttles",
  "and payload, the Garuda",
  "was by the same token excellent",
  "as a means of transporting",
  "mobile suit task forces.",
  "Seized by the AEUG",
  "and the Titans alike, Garudas",
  "came to serve",
  "as mobile bases.",
  "Ships meant to carry",
  "people into space",
  "had become tools for slaughter",
  "on the Earth.",
  "Though it had been made",
  "the bait to lure in the AEUG,",
  "Jaburo still held dozens",
  "of mobile suits and aircraft",
  "at the ready.",
  "Apart from a handful",
  "of Hizacks, most of them were",
  "prototypes of some sort.",
  "In the One Year War's last phase,",
  "the mobile suit as a weapon",
  "was, for both sides,",
  "a history of trial and error.",
  "Ordinarily,",
  "prototypes are trialed",
  "over and over in the rear",
  "and fielded only once",
  "they look fit for real use;",
  "that is the norm in war.",
  "But the chaos of the One Year War",
  "allowed no such",
  "luxury.",
  "Build a prototype somehow,",
  "throw it at the front, use the data",
  "to build yet more prototypes.",
  "Countless prototypes",
  "from both armies",
  "jostled on the battlefield.",
  "Most of these prototypes",
  "were utterly hopeless,",
  "but some, with radical concepts",
  "and superhuman piloting,",
  "left their names in history.",
  "After the war, though,",
  "these machines became a nuisance.",
  "Normally, an army in service",
  "standardizes its models",
  "to cut the costs of",
  "maintenance and supply.",
  "\"That's a Zaku part,",
  "this is a Gouf part,",
  "and they don't fit each other\"",
  "simply won't do.",
  "Standardization was",
  "of course underway,",
  "but with prototypes",
  "it was another story.",
  "In the worst cases,",
  "there were even one-off parts",
  "the engineers had all but",
  "made by hand.",
  "Most of the prototypes",
  "built by the mountain-load",
  "were mothballed",
  "or used up as target drones,",
  "but the Titans",
  "had their eye on them.",
  "If they were throwaway",
  "prototypes anyway,",
  "why not make them decoys",
  "to pad out the numbers?",
  "And so a strange battlefield",
  "was born: a great army",
  "of prototypes and captured",
  "mobile suits, scraped together",
  "from every last Federation lab,",
  "meeting the AEUG's newest",
  "mobile suits head-on.",
  "It looked, indeed,",
  "as if at Jaburo,",
  "the One Year War's very symbol,",
  "the chaos of the last war itself",
  "had come back into view.",
  "\"Let me on, I said.",
  " There's still room!\"",
  "\"One pilot's enough,",
  " ain't it!\"",
  "\"What!\"",
  "\"Let me on! There's still room!",
  " What the hell are you doing!\"",
  "\"It can take three times its load!",
  " Anyone who can still run",
  " can get off and run!\"",
  "Kicking others aside,",
  "trading blows with comrades,",
  "clawing for a place on a shuttle:",
  "such were the Titans' soldiers.",
  "Jerid Messa, who had joined",
  "the wounded, desperate to live,",
  "was among them.",
  "\"From here on,",
  " survive on your own strength.",
  " With luck, you won't die.\"",
  "\"Lieutenant...!\"",
  "\"Don't push! Help me!",
  " Let me on! Please, let me on!\"",
  "\"The weak can only die...",
  " ...the weak!\"",
  "\"What the hell!\"",
  "\"Wait! There's a wounded man",
  " I want to get aboard!",
  " You bastard! Out of the way!\"",
  "\"Waaah!\"",
  "\"Uwah!\"",
  "Mouar",
  "\"...!\"",
  "As Jerid was about to fall,",
  "his hand was caught",
  "by a mysterious woman:",
  "Mouar Pharaoh.",
  "His meeting with her",
  "would draw Jerid deeper",
  "into the whirlpool of fate.",
  "Strangely, at this moment,",
  "he felt no anger at the Titans",
  "who had abandoned him.",
  "Only hatred",
  "for Kamille,",
  "who had driven him into this plight,",
  "and the pride",
  "of having survived even this hell,",
  "the pride of the Right Stuff,",
  "remained in him.",
  "Right behind Jerid",
  "as he flew off,",
  "Jaburo was vanishing."
 ]
}
